      hu: "A(z) Agostinho Neto Egyetem Kampusza az angolai foldrajz es kultura figyelemre melto eleme. Az egyetem kiterjedt új kampusza Luandától délre a modern építészet remekműve. A körkörösen elrendezett kari épületeket árnyékos sétányok kötik össze. 2011-ben adták át. Modern design. Körkörös elrendezés. Ez a nevezetesseg Angola kulturalis oroksegenek resze. Angola szamos jelentos helyszinehez hasonloan ez is otvozi a regionalis sajatossagokat es az altalanos jelentoseget. Ezzel a helyszin hozzajarul Angola sokszinu arculatahoz.",
      ro: "Campusul Universității Agostinho Neto este un element remarcabil al geografiei si culturii angoleze. Noul campus extins al universității la sud de Luanda este o capodoperă a arhitecturii moderne. Clădirile facultăților, dispuse circular, sunt conectate prin alei umbrite. Inaugurat în 2011. Design modern. Dispunere circulară. Acest reper face parte din patrimoniul cultural al Angolei. Asemenea multor locuri importante din Angola, acesta imbina particularitatile regionale cu o semnificatie mai larga. Astfel, acest loc contribuie la profilul variat al Angolei.",
      en: "Agostinho Neto University Campus is a remarkable feature of the geography and culture of Angola. The university's sprawling new campus south of Luanda is a masterpiece of modern architecture. The circularly arranged faculty buildings are connected by shaded walkways. Inaugurated in 2011. Modern design. Circular layout. This landmark is part of the cultural heritage of Angola. Like many notable places in Angola, it combines regional character with wider significance. Thus, this place contributes to the diverse profile of Angola."
